        {
          "text": "Elyo wakaambila Abramu kuti, Koziba calusinizyo kuti, basilunyungu lwako bayooba beenzu mucisi cimbi. Oko bayooba bazike, nkabela bayoobapenzya myaka iili myanda yone. ",
